  "semanticFamilyReview": [
    "Mass-assignment safeguards, direct assignment and scoped unguarding test different write boundaries; none repeats the prior privilege-authorization question.",
    "fresh returns a separate object; refresh reloads the same object and already loaded children. The two cases assess distinct object/state contracts.",
    "Array reassignment versus AsArrayObject is differentiated by an explicit interface requirement, not merely different nouns.",
    "Relationship counts, existence, sums and count-qualified predicates differ in result shape and filtering responsibility.",
    "Primitive query projections and return shapes are Foundation; SQL grouping, casts and relation matching require state/boundary reasoning.",
    "Nested rollback tests surviving writes; nested afterCommit tests callback ownership. Retry questions separately address external side effects.",
    "All new objectives are unique within 300 accepted records; recurring inactive legacy curriculum concepts are disclosed rather than claimed novel concepts."
  ],
